Iwah
$cards
DECK 8 SPADES

$initial
COLUMN 8 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 10 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 9 FACE_LAST

EXEG 5 FACE_HALF
EXEG 10 FACE_HALF
EXEG 1 FACE_HALF
EXEG 0 FACE_ALL
EXEG 9 FACE_ALL
EXEG 2 FACE_ALL

EPAIL 0 FACE_ALL
EPAIL 8 FACE_ALL
EPAIL 7 FACE_ALL
EPAIL 0 FACE_ALL
EPAIL 5 FACE_ALL
EPAIL 6 FACE_ALL

OLAEG 10 FACE_ALL
